{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39471914",
      "title": "Animating Colors & Working with Keyframes",
      "sourceHash": "8f4dbc00c965a790875ac0a89384ab03da84b50d7e86bdabd0df426368c59643",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.78,
          "end": 4.08,
          "en": "Up to this point in this section here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.08,
          "end": 8.43,
          "en": "we pretty much only used numbers as VLUs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.43,
          "end": 11.1,
          "en": "for these different animation properties,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.1,
          "end": 14.25,
          "en": "so for opacity, scale, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.25,
          "end": 19.25,
          "en": "And that's not uncommon because opacity, scale, X and Y",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.59,
          "end": 22.68,
          "en": "are amongst thee most important properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.68,
          "end": 24.81,
          "en": "you might wanna animate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.81,
          "end": 26.34,
          "en": "But it's worth mentioning",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.34,
          "end": 29.583,
          "en": "that you're not limited to simple numbers like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.45,
          "end": 32.58,
          "en": "for example, in this header component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.58,
          "end": 36.21,
          "en": "where we get this button, this button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.21,
          "end": 38.4,
          "en": "that pops when we hover over it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.4,
          "end": 42.06,
          "en": "we could also animate its color, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.06,
          "end": 44.28,
          "en": "which we don't set through a number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.28,
          "end": 46.233,
          "en": "but through a hex code instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.13,
          "end": 48.36,
          "en": "This could be achieved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.36,
          "end": 52.41,
          "en": "by going to the whileHover property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.41,
          "end": 53.97,
          "en": "and then for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.97,
          "end": 57.15,
          "en": "setting the background color property here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.15,
          "end": 59.34,
          "en": "so that we don't just animate the scale,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.34,
          "end": 61.06,
          "en": "but also the background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.98,
          "end": 64.68,
          "en": "and as a color, you can then set a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.68,
          "end": 66.24,
          "en": "that contains the hex code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.24,
          "end": 69.24,
          "en": "of the color you wanna animate to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.24,
          "end": 72.61,
          "en": "So for example, here we could define the hex code 8b11f0",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.741,
          "end": 81.18,
          "en": "to animate to a nice purple background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.18,
          "end": 84.48,
          "en": "and if we save that, you'll see that as I hover over this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.48,
          "end": 87,
          "en": "indeed the color also gets animated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87,
          "end": 90.6,
          "en": "and please note that the color also kind of bounces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.6,
          "end": 95.6,
          "en": "you could say, so that the transition settings set here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.75999999999999,
          "end": 98.07300000000001,
          "en": "are also applied to the color here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.03,
          "end": 101.94,
          "en": "And it's just important to be aware of the fact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.94,
          "end": 105.21000000000001,
          "en": "that you're not limited to animating just the scale,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.21000000000001,
          "end": 107.61,
          "en": "opacity, or position with numbers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.61,
          "end": 111.06,
          "en": "but that you can also animate more complex things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.06,
          "end": 113.463,
          "en": "like colors with Framer Motion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.96000000000001,
          "end": 117.33,
          "en": "Now, with that, I'll actually get rid of the color here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.33,
          "end": 119.03999999999999,
          "en": "because I don't wanna animate it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.03999999999999,
          "end": 121.863,
          "en": "but it's important to understand that you can.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.82,
          "end": 125.58,
          "en": "And there's also some other kind of VLU",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.58,
          "end": 127.5,
          "en": "you should be aware of and for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.5,
          "end": 130.2,
          "en": "I'm back in the NewChallenge.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.2,
          "end": 133.11,
          "en": "and here on this list item which I'm animating,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.11,
          "end": 135.783,
          "en": "these staggered list items here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.92000000000002,
          "end": 140.16,
          "en": "Here on the list item in the visible variant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.16,
          "end": 142.06,
          "en": "I'm setting the scale to 1",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.95,
          "end": 145.38,
          "en": "and with that, I make sure that in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.38,
          "end": 148.68,
          "en": "we animate from a scale of .5 to 1,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.68,
          "end": 150.75,
          "en": "so from half the size I wanna have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.75,
          "end": 152.763,
          "en": "to the size this element should have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 153.87,
          "end": 156.63,
          "en": "But instead of setting a single VLU here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.63,
          "end": 161.16,
          "en": "we can actually also set an array as a VLU here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.16,
          "end": 164.76,
          "en": "and if you do that, if you use an array VLU",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.76,
          "end": 168.24,
          "en": "as a value for a property you're animating,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.24,
          "end": 170.91,
          "en": "you're creating an array of key frames",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 170.91,
          "end": 173.57999999999998,
          "en": "through which Framer Motion will go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 173.57999999999998,
          "end": 176.37,
          "en": "as it animates this item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.37,
          "end": 179.19,
          "en": "so it allows you to define multiple steps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.19,
          "end": 181.08,
          "en": "the animation should go through",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.08,
          "end": 184.773,
          "en": "instead of just having an initial VLU and a final VLU.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 186,
          "end": 187.62,
          "en": "And therefore, here for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.62,
          "end": 190.08,
          "en": "for this visible state of this list item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 190.08,
          "end": 192.51,
          "en": "we could add a bunch of numbers here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 192.51,
          "end": 195.557,
          "en": "and for example, first go to a size of 80%",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.557,
          "end": 200.557,
          "en": "of the size I wanna have, then go up to 1.3,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 200.85,
          "end": 205.85,
          "en": "so 30% bigger than it should be, and then to 1 at the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.98,
          "end": 210.823,
          "en": "so that we go from 50% scale to 80% to 130",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.74,
          "end": 214.32,
          "en": "before we reach the final scale of 1",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 214.32,
          "end": 217.22,
          "en": "which you wanna have, so the size the element should have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.7,
          "end": 220.71,
          "en": "And with that, if we save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 220.71,
          "end": 222.87,
          "en": "if I click Add Challenge here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 222.87,
          "end": 226.07999999999998,
          "en": "those images are again popping in and staggering in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 226.07999999999998,
          "end": 229.59,
          "en": "but they're now actually bouncing slightly differently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 229.59,
          "end": 232.143,
          "en": "according to my key frames here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 233.85,
          "end": 237.06,
          "en": "And that's therefore another feature you should be aware of,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 237.06,
          "end": 240.06,
          "en": "you can set key frames as VLUs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 240.06,
          "end": 242.103,
          "en": "for the properties you're animating.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}